    <detaileddescription>
<para>The transaction extension for recording link relationships</para>
<para>This extension records the relationship between transactions in the LWTR transaction stream.</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>txHandle: the handle of the recorded transaction</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>creator: the creator of the recorded transaction </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
